\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. VICTIM divine, Thy grace we claim,
\par While thus Thy precious death we show:
\par Once offered up, a spotless Lamb,
\par In Thy great temple here below,
\par Thou didst for all mankind atone,
\par And standest now before the throne.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou standest in the holy place,
\par As how for guilty sinners slain:
\par The blood of sprinkling speaks, and prays,
\par All prevalent for helpless man;
\par Thy blood is still our ransom found,
\par And speaks salvation all around.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We need not now go to heaven,
\par To bring the long-sought Saviour down;
\par Thou art to all already given,
\par Thou dost even now Thy banquet crown:
\par To every faithful soul appear,
\par And show Thy real presence here.
\par                             Amen. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

